  message: "Cross-item review 2026-05-17: forms a --gzip-coherence pair with WI-makom (producer-side bug: --gzip silently writes gzipped binary to a non-.gz path). Both stem from the original WI-kojob --gzip introduction. The proposed _load_behavior_map() helper here is the consumer-side half; WI-makom is the producer-side half. The bakeoff-deep helpers (this item's description, scripts/bakeoff-deep:273-302) are a known reference impl for the suffix-detection logic — confirm they survived auto-sync at the cited line numbers before basing the new helper on them."  # 6e3d
