  message: "Fixed in PR #3881 (ae3f576151). Added shared hypergumbo_core.behavior_map_io module exposing load_behavior_map(path) (suffix-routes on .gz) and find_behavior_map(directory, basename) (plain-wins-ties discovery). Migrated all 11 cli.py consumer sites (cmd_sketch, cmd_slice, cmd_search, cmd_routes, cmd_explain, cmd_symbols, cmd_compact, cmd_io_boundaries, cmd_verify_claims, cmd_test_coverage, cmd_dead_code_maybe) plus runtime_coherence.py. Scripts wired: bakeoff-broad, bakeoff-broad-reflect, analyze-artifacts; bakeoff-deep's local helpers retain string-return shapes but delegate to library. bakeoff-deep-reflect / bakeoff-map don't read behavior maps directly (state/metadata JSON only). 11 new unit tests + static-audit + end-to-end parametrized .gz round-trip via cmd_compact."  # a3f7
